=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: dropping pytest from mypy's additional_dependencies removes no test hook
origin: issue #181 bound — a hook is a runner site by its own entry, not by the packages it
origin2: installs; hook edits are weekly routine (precommit_bump_neg) and must stay warn.
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy
    rev: v1.11.2
    hooks:
      - id: mypy
        additional_dependencies: [pytest, types-requests]
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy
    rev: v1.11.2
    hooks:
      - id: mypy
        additional_dependencies: [types-requests]
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
